{"fps": 30, "frames": 1596, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 108, "text": "Scientists once thought one marshmallow could predict a child's future.", "words": [{"w": "Scientists", "f": 0, "e": 14}, {"w": "once", "f": 15, "e": 20}, {"w": "thought", "f": 21, "e": 31}, {"w": "one", "f": 32, "e": 36}, {"w": "marshmallow", "f": 37, "e": 52}, {"w": "could", "f": 53, "e": 60}, {"w": "predict", "f": 61, "e": 71}, {"w": "a", "f": 72, "e": 74}, {"w": "child's", "f": 74, "e": 84}, {"w": "future.", "f": 85, "e": 95}]}, {"a": 108, "b": 201, "text": "Here's the test. A kid sits alone with one marshmallow.", "words": [{"w": "Here's", "f": 110, "e": 118}, {"w": "the", "f": 119, "e": 123}, {"w": "test.", "f": 124, "e": 141}, {"w": "A", "f": 142, "e": 144}, {"w": "kid", "f": 145, "e": 149}, {"w": "sits", "f": 150, "e": 155}, {"w": "alone", "f": 156, "e": 163}, {"w": "with", "f": 164, "e": 169}, {"w": "one", "f": 170, "e": 175}, {"w": "marshmallow.", "f": 175, "e": 191}]}, {"a": 201, "b": 283, "text": "Eat it now, or wait fifteen minutes and get two.", "words": [{"w": "Eat", "f": 203, "e": 207}, {"w": "it", "f": 208, "e": 211}, {"w": "now,", "f": 212, "e": 218}, {"w": "or", "f": 219, "e": 223}, {"w": "wait", "f": 223, "e": 230}, {"w": "fifteen", "f": 230, "e": 241}, {"w": "minutes", "f": 242, "e": 252}, {"w": "and", "f": 253, "e": 257}, {"w": "get", "f": 258, "e": 263}, {"w": "two.", "f": 264, "e": 270}]}, {"a": 283, "b": 423, "text": "Imagine you're four. The clock ticks. That marshmallow is staring at you.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 285, "e": 295}, {"w": "you're", "f": 295, "e": 304}, {"w": "four.", "f": 305, "e": 326}, {"w": "The", "f": 327, "e": 331}, {"w": "clock", "f": 332, "e": 339}, {"w": "ticks.", "f": 340, "e": 348}, {"w": "That", "f": 349, "e": 369}, {"w": "marshmallow", "f": 369, "e": 384}, {"w": "is", "f": 385, "e": 388}, {"w": "staring", "f": 389, "e": 399}, {"w": "at", "f": 400, "e": 403}, {"w": "you.", "f": 404, "e": 409}]}, {"a": 423, "b": 496, "text": "Some kids cover their eyes. Some sing. Some just stare.", "words": [{"w": "Some", "f": 425, "e": 430}, {"w": "kids", "f": 431, "e": 435}, {"w": "cover", "f": 436, "e": 442}, {"w": "their", "f": 443, "e": 449}, {"w": "eyes.", "f": 450, "e": 456}, {"w": "Some", "f": 457, "e": 462}, {"w": "sing.", "f": 463, "e": 469}, {"w": "Some", "f": 470, "e": 475}, {"w": "just", "f": 476, "e": 481}, {"w": "stare.", "f": 482, "e": 489}]}, {"a": 496, "b": 622, "text": "Years later, the kids who waited seemed to do better at school.", "words": [{"w": "Years", "f": 498, "e": 506}, {"w": "later,", "f": 507, "e": 518}, {"w": "the", "f": 519, "e": 538}, {"w": "kids", "f": 539, "e": 546}, {"w": "who", "f": 547, "e": 553}, {"w": "waited", "f": 554, "e": 564}, {"w": "seemed", "f": 565, "e": 575}, {"w": "to", "f": 576, "e": 580}, {"w": "do", "f": 581, "e": 585}, {"w": "better", "f": 586, "e": 596}, {"w": "at", "f": 597, "e": 601}, {"w": "school.", "f": 602, "e": 614}]}, {"a": 622, "b": 779, "text": "So it was all willpower, right? Then, in two thousand twelve, researchers changed one thing.", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 624, "e": 628}, {"w": "it", "f": 628, "e": 632}, {"w": "was", "f": 633, "e": 637}, {"w": "all", "f": 638, "e": 643}, {"w": "willpower,", "f": 644, "e": 658}, {"w": "right?", "f": 659, "e": 681}, {"w": "Then,", "f": 682, "e": 689}, {"w": "in", "f": 690, "e": 694}, {"w": "two", "f": 695, "e": 699}, {"w": "thousand", "f": 700, "e": 712}, {"w": "twelve,", "f": 713, "e": 723}, {"w": "researchers", "f": 724, "e": 740}, {"w": "changed", "f": 740, "e": 751}, {"w": "one", "f": 752, "e": 756}, {"w": "thing.", "f": 757, "e": 766}]}, {"a": 779, "b": 884, "text": "Before the test, an adult promised the kids fancy art supplies.", "words": [{"w": "Before", "f": 781, "e": 791}, {"w": "the", "f": 791, "e": 796}, {"w": "test,", "f": 797, "e": 805}, {"w": "an", "f": 806, "e": 809}, {"w": "adult", "f": 810, "e": 817}, {"w": "promised", "f": 818, "e": 830}, {"w": "the", "f": 831, "e": 836}, {"w": "kids", "f": 837, "e": 843}, {"w": "fancy", "f": 844, "e": 852}, {"w": "art", "f": 852, "e": 857}, {"w": "supplies.", "f": 858, "e": 871}]}, {"a": 884, "b": 953, "text": "For half the kids, she came back with them.", "words": [{"w": "For", "f": 886, "e": 890}, {"w": "half", "f": 891, "e": 896}, {"w": "the", "f": 897, "e": 901}, {"w": "kids,", "f": 902, "e": 909}, {"w": "she", "f": 909, "e": 914}, {"w": "came", "f": 914, "e": 920}, {"w": "back", "f": 921, "e": 926}, {"w": "with", "f": 927, "e": 932}, {"w": "them.", "f": 933, "e": 939}]}, {"a": 953, "b": 1045, "text": "For the other half, she came back empty-handed and said sorry.", "words": [{"w": "For", "f": 955, "e": 959}, {"w": "the", "f": 960, "e": 964}, {"w": "other", "f": 965, "e": 972}, {"w": "half,", "f": 973, "e": 979}, {"w": "she", "f": 980, "e": 984}, {"w": "came", "f": 985, "e": 991}, {"w": "back", "f": 992, "e": 997}, {"w": "empty-handed", "f": 998, "e": 1014}, {"w": "and", "f": 1014, "e": 1019}, {"w": "said", "f": 1019, "e": 1025}, {"w": "sorry.", "f": 1026, "e": 1034}]}, {"a": 1045, "b": 1092, "text": "Then came the marshmallow.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "f": 1047, "e": 1052}, {"w": "came", "f": 1053, "e": 1058}, {"w": "the", "f": 1059, "e": 1063}, {"w": "marshmallow.", "f": 1064, "e": 1079}]}, {"a": 1092, "b": 1171, "text": "Kids who'd been let down waited about three minutes.", "words": [{"w": "Kids", "f": 1094, "e": 1100}, {"w": "who'd", "f": 1101, "e": 1107}, {"w": "been", "f": 1108, "e": 1113}, {"w": "let", "f": 1114, "e": 1118}, {"w": "down", "f": 1119, "e": 1125}, {"w": "waited", "f": 1126, "e": 1133}, {"w": "about", "f": 1134, "e": 1141}, {"w": "three", "f": 1142, "e": 1148}, {"w": "minutes.", "f": 1149, "e": 1160}]}, {"a": 1171, "b": 1251, "text": "Kids who'd seen a kept promise waited about twelve.", "words": [{"w": "Kids", "f": 1173, "e": 1179}, {"w": "who'd", "f": 1179, "e": 1186}, {"w": "seen", "f": 1187, "e": 1193}, {"w": "a", "f": 1194, "e": 1195}, {"w": "kept", "f": 1196, "e": 1202}, {"w": "promise", "f": 1203, "e": 1212}, {"w": "waited", "f": 1213, "e": 1221}, {"w": "about", "f": 1222, "e": 1229}, {"w": "twelve.", "f": 1230, "e": 1239}]}, {"a": 1251, "b": 1312, "text": "Same test. Same marshmallow. Four times the patience.", "words": [{"w": "Same", "f": 1253, "e": 1257}, {"w": "test.", "f": 1258, "e": 1262}, {"w": "Same", "f": 1263, "e": 1266}, {"w": "marshmallow.", "f": 1267, "e": 1277}, {"w": "Four", "f": 1278, "e": 1282}, {"w": "times", "f": 1283, "e": 1287}, {"w": "the", "f": 1288, "e": 1290}, {"w": "patience.", "f": 1291, "e": 1299}]}, {"a": 1312, "b": 1418, "text": "You see, waiting isn't just willpower.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 1314, "e": 1322}, {"w": "see,", "f": 1323, "e": 1333}, {"w": "waiting", "f": 1334, "e": 1362}, {"w": "isn't", "f": 1363, "e": 1375}, {"w": "just", "f": 1376, "e": 1386}, {"w": "willpower.", "f": 1386, "e": 1409}]}, {"a": 1418, "b": 1507, "text": "It's whether you believe the second marshmallow is really coming.", "words": [{"w": "It's", "f": 1420, "e": 1425}, {"w": "whether", "f": 1426, "e": 1434}, {"w": "you", "f": 1435, "e": 1439}, {"w": "believe", "f": 1440, "e": 1448}, {"w": "the", "f": 1449, "e": 1452}, {"w": "second", "f": 1453, "e": 1460}, {"w": "marshmallow", "f": 1461, "e": 1474}, {"w": "is", "f": 1475, "e": 1477}, {"w": "really", "f": 1478, "e": 1485}, {"w": "coming.", "f": 1486, "e": 1494}]}, {"a": 1507, "b": 1596, "text": "And nobody waits for a promise they don't believe.", "words": [{"w": "And", "f": 1509, "e": 1512}, {"w": "nobody", "f": 1513, "e": 1520}, {"w": "waits", "f": 1521, "e": 1527}, {"w": "for", "f": 1528, "e": 1532}, {"w": "a", "f": 1533, "e": 1534}, {"w": "promise", "f": 1535, "e": 1544}, {"w": "they", "f": 1545, "e": 1549}, {"w": "don't", "f": 1550, "e": 1556}, {"w": "believe.", "f": 1557, "e": 1567}]}]}